{
    "title": "24GO by 24 Hour Fitness",
    "description": "Achieve the fitness results you want \u2013 inside and outside of the gym \u2013 with 24GO, the Official App of 24 Hour Fitness.\r\n \r\nDesigned for members or anyone who wants to live fitter, 24GO coaches you on what to do to achieve results, in the ways that work best for you.\r\n \r\nBased on the goals and preferences you enter, 24GO will recommend workouts \u2013 and personalize them to fit your needs, no matter where you are. Custom plans and easy scheduling help keep fitness on your calendar, so you always have what you need to succeed.\r\n \r\n \r\nKNOW WHAT TO DO AND WHEN with Custom Workout Recommendations\r\n \r\n- Get a game plan for success with 24 Smart Start\u2122, a multi-week fitness plan customized to your goals\r\n \r\n- Go straight to working out with workouts picked for you daily that fit your goals, equipment and current location\r\n\r\n- Add workouts & plans to your Favorites to keep your most-loved sessions on repeat\r\n \r\n \r\nACHIEVE YOUR RESULTS FASTER with Hundreds of Workouts and Plans\r\n \r\n- Explore in-club and at home workouts from 24 Hour Fitness and trusted partners like LES MILLS\u00ae, Zumba\u00ae, Kettlebell Kings\u2122 and more\r\n  \r\n- Adapt Smart Workouts to fit your needs in the moment: skip or swap out exercises, change the intensity, or update equipment for the perfect fit\r\n \r\n- Get expert coaching with audio-guided cardio workouts with options available for treadmill, elliptical, bike, rower and more\r\n \r\n- Explore multi-week fitness plans for every goal and personalize them to fit your schedule\r\n \r\nSTAY ON TRACK TO RESULTS with Scheduling and Reminders\r\n \r\n- Allow 24GO access to your mobile calendar, so you can plan out your week and add workouts & classes\r\n \r\n- Receive alerts & reminders about your reserved classes, workouts and training sessions, so you never miss the best part of your day\r\n \r\n- Allow 24GO access to your location to find nearby 24 Hour Fitness clubs & classes\r\n \r\n- Add the 24GO skill to your Alexa Echo device to hear nearby class schedules whenever you like\r\n \r\n \r\nMEASURE YOUR PROGRESS with Performance and Goal Tracking\r\n \r\n- Fitbit integration - Connect your Fitbit account and your 24GO workouts will count towards your goals\r\n \r\n- Heart Rate Monitor integration - Add your Bluetooth 4.0 capable device and view HR inside your workout\r\n\r\n- Earn badges as you work out, check into the club and log activity to celebrate your achievements\r\n \r\n \r\nGET THE MOST FROM YOUR 24 HOUR FITNESS MEMBERSHIP\r\n \r\n- Find 24 Hour Fitness\u00ae clubs, coaches & classes near you when you enable location services\r\n \r\n- Easily check into the club using the QR Code in the app or with Wear OS on your watch\r\n \r\n- Reserve your favorite studio classes, add them to your mobile calendar, set reminders & get real-time updates*\r\n \r\n- Add your 24 Hour Fitness\u00ae coach to your account for extra accountability & personalized support\r\n \r\n \r\n24GO is free to download and use. Messaging and data rates may apply.\r\n\r\nIf you choose to purchase 24 Hour Fitness Digital, payment will be charged to your Google Play Account at confirmation of purchase. The subscription will automatically renew at the applicable price and frequency (i.e., monthly) (exclusive of taxes) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off in your Account Setting in your Google Play Account after purchase. By completing your purchase, you certify that you are at least 18 years old and that you understand and agree to the Terms of Use and acknowledge the Privacy Policy. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during an active subscription period. A user that cancels during a subscription month will not be charged for the following month. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable. \r\n\r\n \r\nThe 24GO Privacy Policy can be found at \r\nhttps://link.24go.co/e/24hourfitnessprivacypolicy\r\n \r\nThe 24GO Terms of Use can be found at https://www.24hourfitness.com/company/policies/terms/terms_of_use.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Achieve the fitness results you want \u2013 inside and outside of the gym \u2013 with 24GO, the Official App of 24 Hour Fitness.<br> <br>Designed for members or anyone who wants to live fitter, 24GO coaches you on what to do to achieve results, in the ways that work best for you.<br> <br>Based on the goals and preferences you enter, 24GO will recommend workouts \u2013 and personalize them to fit your needs, no matter where you are. Custom plans and easy scheduling help keep fitness on your calendar, so you always have what you need to succeed.<br> <br> <br>KNOW WHAT TO DO AND WHEN with Custom Workout Recommendations<br> <br>- Get a game plan for success with 24 Smart Start\u2122, a multi-week fitness plan customized to your goals<br> <br>- Go straight to working out with workouts picked for you daily that fit your goals, equipment and current location<br><br>- Add workouts &amp; plans to your Favorites to keep your most-loved sessions on repeat<br> <br> <br>ACHIEVE YOUR RESULTS FASTER with Hundreds of Workouts and Plans<br> <br>- Explore in-club and at home workouts from 24 Hour Fitness and trusted partners like LES MILLS\u00ae, Zumba\u00ae, Kettlebell Kings\u2122 and more<br>  <br>- Adapt Smart Workouts to fit your needs in the moment: skip or swap out exercises, change the intensity, or update equipment for the perfect fit<br> <br>- Get expert coaching with audio-guided cardio workouts with options available for treadmill, elliptical, bike, rower and more<br> <br>- Explore multi-week fitness plans for every goal and personalize them to fit your schedule<br> <br>STAY ON TRACK TO RESULTS with Scheduling and Reminders<br> <br>- Allow 24GO access to your mobile calendar, so you can plan out your week and add workouts &amp; classes<br> <br>- Receive alerts &amp; reminders about your reserved classes, workouts and training sessions, so you never miss the best part of your day<br> <br>- Allow 24GO access to your location to find nearby 24 Hour Fitness clubs &amp; classes<br> <br>- Add the 24GO skill to your Alexa Echo device to hear nearby class schedules whenever you like<br> <br> <br>MEASURE YOUR PROGRESS with Performance and Goal Tracking<br> <br>- Fitbit integration - Connect your Fitbit account and your 24GO workouts will count towards your goals<br> <br>- Heart Rate Monitor integration - Add your Bluetooth 4.0 capable device and view HR inside your workout<br><br>- Earn badges as you work out, check into the club and log activity to celebrate your achievements<br> <br> <br>GET THE MOST FROM YOUR 24 HOUR FITNESS MEMBERSHIP<br> <br>- Find 24 Hour Fitness\u00ae clubs, coaches &amp; classes near you when you enable location services<br> <br>- Easily check into the club using the QR Code in the app or with Wear OS on your watch<br> <br>- Reserve your favorite studio classes, add them to your mobile calendar, set reminders &amp; get real-time updates*<br> <br>- Add your 24 Hour Fitness\u00ae coach to your account for extra accountability &amp; personalized support<br> <br> <br>24GO is free to download and use. Messaging and data rates may apply.<br><br>If you choose to purchase 24 Hour Fitness Digital, payment will be charged to your Google Play Account at confirmation of purchase. The subscription will automatically renew at the applicable price and frequency (i.e., monthly) (exclusive of taxes) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off in your Account Setting in your Google Play Account after purchase. By completing your purchase, you certify that you are at least 18 years old and that you understand and agree to the Terms of Use and acknowledge the Privacy Policy. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during an active subscription period. A user that cancels during a subscription month will not be charged for the following month. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable. <br><br> <br>The 24GO Privacy Policy can be found at <br>https://link.24go.co/e/24hourfitnessprivacypolicy<br> <br>The 24GO Terms of Use can be found at https://www.24hourfitness.com/company/policies/terms/terms_of_use.html",
